Package: openhsp
Architecture: any
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Suggests:
 openhsp-gpio-gpiod,
 openhsp-gpio-sysfs
Description: Hot Soup Processor tools and Linux runtimes
 OpenHSP provides the Hot Soup Processor compiler and Linux runtimes.
 This package installs the command-line compiler, console runtime,
 HSP3Dish runtime, HGIMG4 runtime, and common include files.

Package: openhsp-gpio-gpiod
Architecture: any
Build-Profiles: <!nogpiod>
Depends:
 openhsp (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: libgpiod GPIO provider for OpenHSP runtimes
 This package enables GPIO commands in the OpenHSP Linux runtimes through
 libgpiod.  It is intended for systems such as Raspberry Pi or x86 single
 board computers that expose GPIO lines through the Linux GPIO character
 device interface.

Package: openhsp-gpio-sysfs
Architecture: any
Depends:
 openhsp (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: sysfs GPIO provider for OpenHSP runtimes
 This package enables GPIO commands in the OpenHSP Linux runtimes through
 /sys/class/gpio.  It preserves the legacy Raspberry Pi GPIO access method
 for systems that still expose the Linux GPIO sysfs interface.

Package: openhsp-hsed
Section: editors
Architecture: any
Depends:
 openhsp (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: GTK2 script editor for Hot Soup Processor
 This package provides the lightweight GTK2 HSP script editor and desktop
 launcher for the OpenHSP Linux tools.
